SDUSD::setPauser
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when enabling a pauser
    │   ├── it should set the pauser status for the specified pause type to true
    │   └── it should emit PauserUpdated
    ├── when disabling a pauser
    │   ├── it should set the pauser status for the specified pause type to false
    │   └── it should emit PauserUpdated
    ├── when pauser is zero address
    │   ├── it should set the requested status
    │   └── it should emit PauserUpdated
    ├── when pauser already has the requested status
    │   ├── it should complete successfully
    │   └── it should emit PauserUpdated
    └── when pause type differs from PAUSE_TYPE
        ├── it should update only the specified pause type
        └── it should leave PAUSE_TYPE authorization unchanged
